<title>USA: Longview, Texas $5.985 won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Longview, Texas $5.985 won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it won $5.985 million of Longview, Texas, general obligation limited tax bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.57 percent.</p>
</text>
